{"id": "unknown-2026-07-07-010", "date": "2026-07-07", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "ISFH now offering calibration services for large-area tandem solar cells", "content": "<p>Germany’s Institute for Solar Energy Research Hamelin (ISFH) said it will begin providing calibration services for perovskite-silicon tandem solar cells up to the G12 wafer format.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/07/isfh-now-offering-calibration-services-for-large-area-tandem-solar-cells/\">ISFH now offering calibration services for large-area tandem solar cells</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/07/isfh-now-offering-calibration-services-for-large-area-tandem-solar-cells/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-07-011", "date": "2026-07-07", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["improve"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "New methodology to prevent false data injection attacks in PV plants", "content": "<p>Researchers in Spain developed a cyber-resilient framework to detect and identify false data injection attacks in utility-scale PV plants using EC-WLSE and EC-SHGME state estimation techniques. The proposed method improves PV plant cybersecurity by detecting sophisticated measurement manipulations, maintaining reliable state estimation.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/07/new-methodology-to-prevent-false-data-injection-attacks-in-pv-plants/\">New methodology to prev", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/07/new-methodology-to-prevent-false-data-injection-attacks-in-pv-plants/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "enphase-2026-07-07-012", "date": "2026-07-07", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": ["enphase"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Enphase targets 800 V DC data centers with distributed solid-state transformers", "content": "<p>Enphase Energy representative Andy Newbold told pv magazine the company sees its distributed solid-state transformer model supporting utility-scale solar, batteries, and high-power EV charging eventually. The initial focus, however, will be on data centers.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/07/enphase-targets-800-v-dc-data-centers-with-distributed-solid-state-transformers/\">Enphase targets 800 V DC data centers with distributed solid-state transformers</a> appeared ", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/07/enphase-targets-800-v-dc-data-centers-with-distributed-solid-state-transformers/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-07-013", "date": "2026-07-07", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "UK CfD price ceiling and new auction framework for solar revealed", "content": "<p>Government publishes administrative prices for eighth allocation round (AR8), new auction pot structure, and adds an extra delivery year for solar and onshore wind. Load factors remain the same across technologies, but applicants will need a grid connection agreement to proceed. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/07/uk-cfd-price-ceiling-and-new-auction-framework-for-solar-revealed/\">UK CfD price ceiling and new auction framework for solar revealed</a> appeared first", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/07/uk-cfd-price-ceiling-and-new-auction-framework-for-solar-revealed/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-07-014", "date": "2026-07-07", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Ivory Coast switches on 52 MW of solar", "content": "<p>The 52 MW solar project is set to produce 90 GWh of electricity annually, supporting more than 370,000 households alongside schools, health centers and businesses in the northern region of Tchologo.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/07/ivory-coast-switches-on-52-mw-of-solar/\">Ivory Coast switches on 52 MW of solar</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/07/ivory-coast-switches-on-52-mw-of-solar/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-07-015", "date": "2026-07-07", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 28, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -1.0, "keywords": ["[否定]surpass"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["情緒極端"]}, "title": "Recycling of spin-triplet excitons enables 20.5% efficiency in organic solar cell", "content": "<p>Organic solar cells have reached over 20% certified power conversion efficiency, with laboratory-scale devices surpassing 21% through innovations in non-fullerene acceptors and device optimization.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/07/recycling-of-spin-triplet-excitons-enables-20-5-efficiency-in-organic-solar-cell/\">Recycling of spin-triplet excitons enables 20.5% efficiency in organic solar cell</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazin", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/07/recycling-of-spin-triplet-excitons-enables-20-5-efficiency-in-organic-solar-cell/", "type": "rss"}]}
